{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And he called its name.</b> He called the name of the Holy One, blessed be He, in his prayer, as in קָרָאתִי שִׁמְךָ ה׳ (Lamentations 3:55)." "<b>YHWH my banner.</b> YHWH will be my exaltation, as in נָתַתָּה לִּירֵאֶיךָ נֵס לְהִתְנוֹסֵס (Psalms 60:6) — that is, YHWH will be my excellence and exaltation above all who rise up, as in וּבְשִׁמְךָ נָבוּס קָמֵינוּ (Psalms 44:6), and as in וּבִשְׁמִי תָּרוּם קַרְנוֹ (Psalms 89:25)."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:01.032421834Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}